<Layouts.marketing current_page={:services}>
  <section class="m-hero" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <div class="m-container">
      <div class="m-eyebrow">Our Services</div>
      <h1>Full-chain freight, forwarding, and logistics.</h1>
      <p class="m-lede">
        The complex of compliances, security, and customs regulations can affect shipments.
        Handling different types of freight requires specialists — that's what our team, and our
        L.I.N.K Global Network, are built for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m-section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="m-container">
      <div class="m-services-list">
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">01</div>
          <h3>Airfreight</h3>
          <p>
            On-Time Delivery is crucial for every shipment. Our network of airlines and partners
            are your assurance of reliability — handling general goods to dangerous materials
            using ULDs, pallets, and main deck containers for security and efficient clearance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">02</div>
          <h3>Ocean Freight</h3>
          <p>When costs matter, Ocean Freight is the answer to cost savings for non-Just-in-Time (JIT) shipments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">03</div>
          <h3>Transportation / Overland Trucking Delivery</h3>
          <p>We take good care of getting clients' deliveries expeditiously from point to point, locally to cross border.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">04</div>
          <h3>Customs Clearance &amp; Total Documentation</h3>
          <p>We take care of clients' shipments efficiently as we stay connected on the myriad of customs regulations and compliance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">05</div>
          <h3>Warehousing, Packing &amp; Distribution</h3>
          <p>We provide cost viable and secured storage at our warehouse, located within the Free Trade Zone (FTZ).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">06</div>
          <h3>Third Party Logistics</h3>
          <p>We offer dedicated Third Party Logistics services at any point, locally to internationally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">07</div>
          <h3>Project Freight &amp; Live Shows</h3>
          <p>We have a proven track record handling small to large scale projects for different industries, locally to internationally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-service-row" style="cursor: default;">
          <div class="m-num">08</div>
          <h3>Specialized Services</h3>
          <p>Merstar International delivers more than just cargo — Pharma Logistics, Perishables, AOG, Charter Flights/Vessels, Ship Supplies, Procurement, and E-Commerce delivery, tailored to clients' needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m-section" style="background:#ffffff; border-top:1px solid var(--m-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--m-line);">
    <div class="m-container">
      <div class="m-section-head">
        <div class="m-eyebrow">Airfreight Expertise</div>
        <h2>Specialists for the shipments that can't go wrong.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="m-network-grid">
        <div class="m-network-cell"><div class="m-region">Handling</div><div class="m-place">Perishables</div></div>
        <div class="m-network-cell"><div class="m-region">Compliance</div><div class="m-place">Dangerous Goods (DGR)</div></div>
        <div class="m-network-cell"><div class="m-region">Routing</div><div class="m-place">Air-Sea / Sea-Air</div></div>
        <div class="m-network-cell"><div class="m-region">Speed</div><div class="m-place">Door-to-Door &amp; Express</div></div>
        <div class="m-network-cell"><div class="m-region">Time-Critical</div><div class="m-place">On-Board Courier</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m-section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="m-container">
      <div class="m-cta-band">
        <div>
          <h2>Not sure which service fits?</h2>
          <p>Tell us the cargo, the lane, and the deadline — we'll tell you the right mode.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/request-for-quote" class="m-btn m-btn-primary">Request for Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layouts.marketing>
